        "accordion_ByhxAr": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "<p>Bundle Details</p>",
            "video_link": "",
            "above_content": "",
            "content": "<p><strong>What Makes Ultra Clean Bundle Special</strong></p><p>The Ultra Clean Bundle includes a 30-day supply of powerful cleaning tablets, our Fresh Cleaning Foam, a soft-bristle brush designed for gentle care, and a dual-purpose storage and cleaning case with a built-in mirror. Whether you’re at home or on the go, this all-in-one set makes it easy to keep your oral appliances fresh, protected, and ready for everyday wear.</p><p><strong>Pop On Clean</strong></p><p>Drop one tablet into water to remove odors, stains, and 99.9% of bacteria from aligners, retainers, night guards, and dentures. A deep clean without the hassle.</p><p><strong>Pop On Foam</strong></p><p>This no-rinse foam refreshes your mouth and oral appliance wherever you are. Use it in your case, on your brush, or directly in your mouth for a quick, minty clean - no sink needed.</p><p><strong>Clean & Go Case</strong></p><p>Your soak-and-store solution. Use it to deep clean your appliance with tablets, or simply carry it safely wherever you go. It also has a handy mirror. Compact, sleek, and ready for daily use.</p><p><strong>Pop On Toothbrush</strong></p><p>Soft enough for delicate oral appliances, tough enough for everyday freshness. Use with foam or water to keep your appliance clean and your mouth feeling great.</p>",
            "page": "",
